OL,3,GNEWSASwim death teen suffered cold
OL,4,Awater shock
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager drowned after suffering cold
OL,7,Fwater shock while swimming with friends
OL,8,Fin a Lake District tarn, a coroner has
OL,9,Fconcluded.
OL,11,FAbsi Ahmed Mohammad, 17 and from
OL,12,FPoulton-le-Fylde in Lancashire, died at
OL,13,FHigh Dam near Windermere on 7 April,
OL,14,FCumbria Coroner's Court heard.
OL,16,FThe "lovely and kind" boy was with
OL,17,Fthree friends when he got into
OL,18,Fdifficulty trying to reach an island at
OL,19,Fthe popular swimming spot, the inquest
OL,20,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
