OL,3,GNEWSASwim death teen suffered cold
OL,4,Awater shock
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcluding his death was a result of
OL,7,Fmisadventure, senior coroner Kirsty
OL,8,FGomersal urged people to follow open
OL,9,Fwater swimming advice in what had been
OL,10,Fa "tragic year" for deaths nationally.
